        "text": "<thinking> To implement the detect_image_labels.py file, I need to use a concrete external provider for image label detection. Google Cloud Vision API is a suitable choice for this task. I will import the necessary Google Cloud Vision client library and use it to detect labels in a static image. The provider will be identifiable by the import statement and the use of the Google Cloud Vision client. </thinking>\n",
